            "<p><strong>Description</strong></p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Flatbed Scanner</p>",
            "<p>Most common scanner used for documents and photos.</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Handheld Scanner</p>",
            "<p>Portable scanner moved manually over the document.</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Drum Scanner</p>",
            "<p>Used for high-quality image scanning in publishing.</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s18n62t",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "4.4 Barcode Reader"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "spcmski",
      "content": "A barcode reader is an input device used to read barcodes printed on products. It converts barcode patterns into digital data."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "n8kb5z0",
      "content": "Common Uses:"
    },
    {
      "id": "lkbby66",
      "type": "list",
      "items": [
        "Retail stores",
        "Inventory management",
        "Libraries",
        "Logistics tracking"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "6npmlwv",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "4.5 OMR, OCR, MICR"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "MICR (Magnetic Ink Character Recognition) uses special magnetic ink and is primarily tested in relation to bank cheque processing.",
        "OMR (Optical Mark Recognition) is specifically used for reading pre-printed forms and evaluating MCQ answer sheets.",
        "OCR (Optical Character Recognition) converts printed or handwritten text images into editable electronic text."
      ],
      "id": "f5uwpl4"
    },
    {
      "id": "3fu1jr6",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
